<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
  <head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8" />
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1" />
    <link rel="shortcut icon" type="image/x-icon" href="img/favicon.ico" />
    <title>The Alchemist Zodiac</title>
    <link rel="stylesheet" href="css/styles.css" />
    <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com" />
    <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.gstatic.com" crossorigin />
    <link
      href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Jacquard+12&display=swap"
      rel="stylesheet"
    />
    <link
      href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=VT323&display=swap"
      rel="stylesheet"
    />
  </head>
  <body class="body">
    <div class="container">
      <main class="main zodiac">
        <h1 class="huge">The Alchemist Zodiac</h1>
        <p>
          From the private pages of the old alchemist's study, a simple, secret
          pattern unfolds ten celestial dispositions aligned to the ancient
          primal elements. Study thy date of birth and uncover thy true
          alchemical nature.
        </p>
        <section class="zodiac-intro">
          <h3>Calculate Your Alchemical Sigil</h3>
          <blockquote class="quote">
            “By number, all things are made known. Within thy birth date lies
            the cipher of thy elemental self.”
          </blockquote>
          <p>
            To divine one's Alchemical Sign, take the day of thy birth and
            <em>reduce it to a single digit by summing its parts.</em>
            Shouldst thou be born on the 12th October 1875, thou shalt perform:
          </p>
          <p>1 + 2 + 1 + 0 + 1 + 8 + 7 + 5 = 25 = 2 + 5 = <em>7</em></p>
          <p>
            If this sacred sum results ends in <em>zero</em> and above the 10th,
            consider it <em>10</em>, the sacred number of unity in duality.
          </p>
          <p>
            This final digit reveals thy <em>elemental dominion</em>, drawn from
            the mystic wheel of ten sacred alchemical signs.
          </p>
        </section>
        <section class="signs">
          <article class="sign" id="silver">
            <h3 class="sign-name">Luna</h3>
            <p>
              You harbor depth and reflection. Soft yet powerful, your emotions
              flow like rivers—calming, cleansing, and profoundly intuitive.
            </p>
          </article>
            <h3 class="sign-name">Mars</h3>
            <p>
              You are the alchemist's strength, steadfast and enduring. Your
              essence is both solid and transformative, embodying the power of
              resilience. You forge connections and build bridges between
              worlds, grounding the alchemical process in reality.
            </p>

        </section>
        <button
          class="button"
          type="button"
          onclick="javascript:window.close()"
        >
          Close
        </button>
      </main>
    </div>

    <script src="js/scripts.js"></script>
  </body>
</html>
